# Test directory for @morocco-pc/offer-ingestion

Test strategy per RFC §12 and §22.2:

1. Unit tests for `src/` modules — DB-free, no network, no env. Each module
   is tested with supplied inputs and asserted outputs.
2. CLI tests for `bin/ingest-offers.js` — stub `pg` Client, verify target
   resolution and dry-run vs commit behavior.
3. Gate tests for `gates/` — stub `pg` Client, verify verdict logic.

No test here may import `@morocco-pc/recommendation-core` or
`@morocco-pc/recommendation-runtime`. See RFC §12.3 hard rule.
